---
/**
 * Orca worktree 終端機裡跑 Claude Code 的示意：第一次啟動出現信任對話。
 * 重點是「Orca 的終端機＝一般終端機，畫面跟 CLI 路線一致」。固定深色外框的「示意圖」。
 */
---

<figure class="orca-demo">
	<div class="orca-window not-content">
		<div class="orca-bar" aria-hidden="true">
			<span class="orca-dot"></span><span class="orca-dot"></span><span class="orca-dot"></span>
			<span class="orca-title">Orca — claude-code-practice</span>
		</div>
		<div class="orca-body">
			<aside class="orca-side">
				<div class="side-label">Repos</div>
				<div class="side-repo"><span>▾ claude-code-practice</span><span class="plus">＋</span></div>
				<div class="side-item active"><span class="dot run"></span>hello · Claude Code</div>
			</aside>
			<div class="orca-main">
				<div class="pane">
					<div class="pane-head">hello — Claude Code <span class="dot run"></span></div>
					<pre class="pane-term"><span class="dim">（worktree 建立後 Orca 自動啟動 claude）</span>
<span class="hl">Do you trust the files in this folder?</span>
<span class="out">❯ 1. Yes, proceed</span>
<span class="dim">  2. No, exit</span></pre>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<figcaption class="orca-caption"><span class="orca-tag">示意圖</span><slot /></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.orca-demo {
		margin: 1.25rem 0;
	}
	.orca-window {
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
	.orca-bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		min-width: 24rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
		background: #1c2128;
		border: 1px solid #30363d;
		border-bottom: none;
		border-radius: 0.6rem 0.6rem 0 0;
	}
	.orca-dot {
		width: 0.65rem;
		height: 0.65rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #3d444d;
	}
	.orca-title {
		margin-inline-start: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #8b949e;
		font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, monospace);
	}
	.orca-body {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 24rem;
		background: #10141a;
		border: 1px solid #30363d;
		border-radius: 0 0 0.6rem 0.6rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.orca-side {
		flex: 0 0 10.5rem;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		border-inline-end: 1px solid #30363d;
	}
	.side-label {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #767f89;
	}
	.side-repo {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
		color: #e6edf3;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.plus {
		padding: 0 0.45rem;
		border: 1px solid #30363d;
		border-radius: 0.35rem;
		color: #8b949e;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.side-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		padding-inline-start: 1rem;
		color: #c9d1d9;
		font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, monospace);
	}
	.side-item.active {
		color: #e6edf3;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.orca-main {
		flex: 1;
		min-width: 0;
		display: flex;
		padding: 0.75rem;
	}
	.pane {
		flex: 1;
		min-width: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		background: #0d1117;
		border: 1px solid #30363d;
		border-radius: 0.45rem;
	}
	.pane-head {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
		color: #e6edf3;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-family: var(--sl-font-mono, monospace);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
	}
	.pane-head .dot {
		margin-inline-start: auto;
	}
	.pane-term {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
		background: transparent;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.pane-term span {
		display: block;
		white-space: nowrap;
		overflow: hidden;
		text-overflow: ellipsis;
	}
	.cmd {
		color: #e6edf3;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.out {
		color: #c9d1d9;
	}
	.dim {
		color: #767f89;
	}
	.hl {
		color: #f0946a;
	}
	.dot {
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		width: 0.55rem;
		height: 0.55rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
	}
	.dot.run {
		background: #f0946a;
	}
	.orca-caption {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.orca-caption :global(p) {
		display: inline;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.orca-tag {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-inline-end: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0 0.45rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
</style>
